name: Child-target findings retain correct parent-workspace paths and source through Review and Report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/open-client.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 client/package.json:1 | prepared-child-source
expect: Package manifest does not declare a license
ask: Does the headless relative child-target scan reopen as client/package.json in the parent workspace, with the client's source rather than the parent's manifest?
submit: logs
submit: run license-scan:scan {"target":"service"}
require-live-snap: 35 license-scan: 1 finding | service-license
submit: run dep-hygiene:check {"target":"client"}
require-live-snap: 35 dep-hygiene: 1 risky specifier | client-dependency
submit: run dep-hygiene:check {"target":"service"}
require-live-snap: 35 dep-hygiene: 1 risky specifier | service-dependency
submit: run secret-scan:scan {"target":"client","maxEntries":16,"maxFileBytes":2048,"maxTotalBytes":8192,"maxFindings":4}
require-live-snap: 35 secret-scan: 1 finding | client-secret
submit: run secret-scan:scan {"target":"service","maxEntries":16,"maxFileBytes":2048,"maxTotalBytes":8192,"maxFindings":4}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME six
require-live-snap: 35 secret-scan: 1 finding | service-secret
type: preserve module audit draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME sast-run
require-live-snap: 25 preserve module audit draft | external-sast-draft
ask: Do three explicit headless SAST checks preserve the live composer while retaining the same six child findings and adding only their three observations?
keys: C-u
paste-file: @ART/open-client.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 client/package.json:1 | current-client-source
submit: decision deferred Owned child metadata needs owner review
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: deferred | child-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME reviewed
resize: 160x48
live-snap: child-review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: child-review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: child-review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: child-review-60x20
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 q review list | child-reader
resize: 40x12
live-snap: child-review-40x12
expect: client/package.json:1
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-source-page-1
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-source-page-2
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-source-page-3
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-source-page-4
keys: NPage
live-snap: child-source-page-5
ask: Across six sizes and normal paging, is the client finding's identity, source and deferral readable without substituting the parent or sibling manifest?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Enter export | report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json | json-report
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-client.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 client/package.json:1 | recovered-child
expect: recorded: deferred
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/child_target_sources.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain nine finite local scans, nine observations, six workspace-qualified findings, one decision and the exported source references with no paid calls or source execution?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
